      <section class="section">
        <div class="shell prose">
          <h2>One thing worth knowing</h2>
          <p>
            <strong>THC varies from batch to batch.</strong> Cannabis is a crop, and two
            harvests of the same strain test differently. The potency printed against a
            product is the figure from the certificate of analysis for the batch that is
            physically on the shelf, so it moves when the batch does. Ask any budtender
            for the certificate on a specific jar.
          </p>
          <p>
